$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (E)-1,1-Difluoro-4-phenyl-1-(phenylsulfonyl)but-3-en-2-ol (25a) Under N2
atmosphere, into a Schlenk tube containing cinnamaldehyde 24 (264 mg, 2.0
mmol) and PhSO2CF2H 2 ( 192 mg, 1.0 mmol) in THF-HMPA (5 mL/0.5mL) at
-78°C, was added dropwise a THF solution (2.0 mL) of LHMDS (1.0M in THF,
2.0 mmol). The reaction mixture was then stirred vigorously at -78 °C for
30 min, followed by adding a saturated NH4Cl water solution (5 mL) at
this temperature. The solution mixture was extracted with EtOAc (20 mL3),
and the combined organic phase was dried over MgSO4. After the removal of
volatile solvents under vacuum, the crude product was further purified by
silica gel column chromatography (petroleum ether/EtOAc 6:1 as eluent)
give product 25a (84% yeld). 1H NMR (CDCl3): δ 3.07 (d, J = 5.5 Hz, 1H);
5.15 (m, 1H); 6.25 (dd, J = 15.8 Hz, 6.7 Hz, 1H); 6.89 (d, J = 16 Hz,
1H); 7.29-7.43 (m, 5H); 7.63 (t, J = 8 Hz, 2H); 7.77 (t, J = 8 Hz, 1H);
8.00 (d, J = 8 Hz, 2H). 19F NMR (CDCl3): δ -107.0 (dd, J = 237 Hz, 6 Hz,
1F); -116.6 (dd, J = 237 Hz, 17 Hz, 1F).
