$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Compound S-10 (1.0 g, 5.94 mmol) was dissolved in THF 15 mL, and cooled
to 0 °C. To this solution was added slowly PhMgCl (7.8 ml, 1 M in THF),
and the resulting solution was stirred for 2 min at 0 °C before addition
of water. The solution was extracted with ethyl acetate (three times),
concentrated under reduced pressure, and eluted through a silica column
(hexane/ethyl acetate:10/1) to afford compound S-45 (1.39 g , 5.64 mmol,
95%).
