$DATUM (E)-(3S,4S,7S,8R,9S,11S)-12-tert-Butyldiphenylsilyloxy-3,8,9-trimethoxy-5,7,11-
trimethyldodec-1,5-dien-4-ol (28): To a stirred solution of allyl methyl
ether (853 mg, 11.85 mmol, 3.3 equiv) in dry THF (13 mL), at -78 °C, was
added dropwise sec-butyllithium (1.4 M in cyclohexane, 9 mL, 10.8 mmol, 3
equiv). After 30 min at -78 °C, a solution of
(+)-B-methoxydiisocampheylborane in THF (9 mL, 1 M, 9 mmol, 3 equiv) was
added via cannula. After 1 h of stirring at -78 °C, a solution of
aldehyde 9 (1.78 g, 3.59 mmol, 1 equiv) in THF (10 mL) was added via
cannula, followed immediately by the dropwise addition of BF3.Et2O (1.5
mL, 11.85 mmol, 3.3 equiv). The reaction mixture was allowed to warm
slowly to -50 °C and stirred for 2 h and then to -5 °C. Solvents were
evaporated in vacuo and pentane and ethanolamine were added at 0 °C.
After 2.5 h at 0 °C, the mixture was filtered through Celite and washed
with cold pentane. Purification of the crude residue by chromatography on
silica gel (pentane/EtOAc: 95/5) provided the desired alcohol 28 (1.49 g,
73%) as a colorless oil. C34H52O5Si; M = 568 g.mol-1; Rf = 0.29
(Petroleum ether/EtOAc: 8/2); [α]D 20 +29.5 (c 0.63, CHCl3); IR: 3430,
2929, 2856, 1471, 1426, 1386, 1232, 1189, 1153, 1096, 1064, 1006, 972,
927, 872, 817, 799, 741, 702, 689, 613 cm-1; 1H NMR (300 MHz): δ:
7.70-7.63 (4H), 7.45-7.31 (6H), 5.53 (ddd, 1H, J = 17.5, J = 10.0 and J =
7.7 Hz), 5.32-5.20 (3H), 3.84 (d, 1H, J = 8.3 Hz), 3.59 (dd syst AB, 1H,
2 J = 9.6 and J = 5.1 Hz), 3.51 (app t, 1H, J = 7.9 Hz), 3.44 (s, 3H),
3.42 (dd syst AB, 1H, 2 J = 9.6 and J = 7.2 Hz), 3.33 (s, 3H), 3.29 (s,
3H), 3.16 (dt, 1H, J = 10.5 and J = 2.3 Hz), 3.07 (dd, 1H, J = 8.5 and J
= 2.5 Hz), 2.91 (broad s, 1H), 2.45 (m, 1H), 1.88 (m, 1H), 1.65 (ddd syst
AB, 1H, 2 J = 14.4, J = 10.5 and J = 4.1 Hz), 1.60 (d, 3H, J = 1.5 Hz),
1.14 (m, 1H), 1.05 (s, 9H), 1.03 (d, 3H, J = 6.8 Hz), 0.93 (d, 3H, J =
6.4 Hz); 13C NMR (75.5 MHz): δ: 135.7 (4d), 134.3 (2s), 134.1 (d), 133.6
(d), 132.5 (s), 129.5 (2d), 127.5 (4d), 119.6 (t), 84.9 (2d), 81.0 (d),
80.4 (d), 69.7 (t), 60.7 (q), 57.0 (q), 56.5 (q), 34.7 (d), 32.7 (t),
32.5 (d), 26.9 (3q), 19.4 (s), 17.0 (q), 16.9 (q), 12.2 (q).
